        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ee454990-0c4b-49e5-9572-a67887325283).Image",
        "Description": "(TO BE PLAYED AFTER &quot;Hawke&apos;s Bay Blackout&quot;)\r\rGood evening, 47.\r\rThe New Zealand contract went off without a hitch, a nice warmup for a series of electrifying events.\r\rThe client is pleased, but now has their sights set on Sierra and Robert Knox, who are stationed at a racing event in Miami, Florida.\r\rThis may be challenging, though I have word that the host of the event, Maxwell Rutter, holds a dongle that can end the race early. You will find him in his office, above the garages. Good luck, 47.",
